NAME
     logger - write a line to the log

SYNOPSIS
     logger [-p FACILITY.LEVEL] [-t TAG] [-s] [MESSAGE...]

DESCRIPTION
     logger sends a message to syslogd. With no MESSAGE it sends what it
     reads from standard input, a line at a time.

OPTIONS
     -p FACILITY.LEVEL   which facility and how serious
     -t TAG              the tag to put in front of it
     -s                  also write it to standard error

SEE ALSO
     syslogd(8), dmesg(1)
